A reference definition is anchored at end of line

```
[a]: /u zzz

[a][]
.
<p>[a]: /u zzz</p>
<p>[a][]</p>
```

```
[a]: /u "T" zzz

[a][]
.
<p>[a]: /u “T” zzz</p>
<p>[a][]</p>
```

```
[a]: /u	"T"

[a][]
.
<p>[a]: /u	“T”</p>
<p>[a][]</p>
```

```
[a]: /u 	"T"

[a][]
.
<p>[a]: /u 	“T”</p>
<p>[a][]</p>
```

```
[a]: /u	 "T"

[a][]
.
<p>[a]: /u	 “T”</p>
<p>[a][]</p>
```

```
[a]: /u	{.c}

[a][]
.
<p>[a]: /u	{.c}</p>
<p>[a][]</p>
```

```
[a]: /u 	{.c}

[a][]
.
<p>[a]: /u 	{.c}</p>
<p>[a][]</p>
```

```
[a]: /u	 {.c}

[a][]
.
<p>[a]: /u	 {.c}</p>
<p>[a][]</p>
```

```
[a]: /u{.c}

[a][]
.
<p><a href="/u{.c}">a</a></p>
```

```
[a]: /u "T" {.c}

[a][]
.
<p><a href="/u" title="T" class="c">a</a></p>
```
